>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>cosh</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
