mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>tanh</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>cosh</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>tanh</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>cosh</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now we find the hyperbolic identities corresponding to the trigonometric identities \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"93\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx